      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}\n\n I fully looked over the release notes, and I understand why they removed the icon in the first place. \n\nBut what I am saying is they should bring it back, possibly a different color, and the badge MUST state the user who is ID Verified is under the age of 18. Just like the example names I gave. \n\nI don't think it should be just for cosmetic purposes, but it is way easier for instance host and mods to identify who is ID Verified, who is over 18, and who is under 18.\n\nBack to the marker option, keep the people over 18 the same two options, take it off, or be over 18, for people under 18, take it off, or show your under 18 to remove that confusion of if they are 18 or older.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
