  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "People under 18 should be able to show the huge badge that people over 18 have, but without the 18+ part. Pretty much just removing the Verified 18+ option (attachment) and giving people under 18 one that says either \"Verified\", \"Verified -18\", \"Verified 13-17\"\n\nSure, they already have the small checkmark on their shield but this is very easily overlooked as part of the Trust Level System. Giving under 18's the larger ID verified badge helps to show easily they are ID Verified\n\nSome people might ask: why would a user under 18 need a large badge if they aren't joining 18+ instances? Some instances age check other users to make sure they are following VRChat ToS by being 13+ many instances, again, overlook the checkmark as a trust level.",
